    "scandium": "Use Dong2024 malonate separation of Sc from synthetic mixed REEs; preserve single column run, protein-origin vs expression-host identity, unreported column temperature, reagent-dependent outcome, feed concentration/table-label conflicts and lack of a direct Sc resin-only comparator. Do not substitute fitted affinity for recovery.",
    "praseodymium": "Use Diep2026 Melba-LanM binary Pr/La experiment and lower repeat outcomes; retain exact construct, expression host, cell-free assay, selected-fraction denominator, scale/schedule differences and source workbook annotation limitations. Dong2024 grouped Pr-Eu enrichment is not a purified-Pr result."
  },
